<title>USA: Conestoga Enterprises to buyback shares.</title>
<headline>Conestoga Enterprises to buyback shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conestoga Enterprises Inc said its board approved the repurchase of up to 100,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The telecommunications firm said it currently has about 4.5 million common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
